{"sourceUrl":"http://nibs.ac.cn/yjsjyshow.php?cid=8&sid=26&zid=78&id=2847","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:27.045406+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjyshow.php?cid=8&sid=26&zid=78&id=2847","html":"<div>\n<div>\r\n\t\t 当前位置：\r\n         <a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">首页</a> / <a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生教育</a> / <a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=78\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">招生与培养</a> / <a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=78\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIBS推免招生与培养</a> / 正文         \r\n\t</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2>研究生教育</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjyshow.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=78&amp;id=2847\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生院</a>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=24&amp;zid=89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生院简介</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=24&amp;zid=88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生院新闻</a>\n</div> </li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjyimg.php?cid=8&amp;sid=25\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生导师</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjyshow.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=78&amp;id=2847\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">招生与培养</a>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=78\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIBS推免招生与培养</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PTN项目招生与培养</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=86\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">系列讲座</a>\n</div> </li>\n<li